  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;docs-internal-guid-2659ccad-7fff-1aa4-a1e2-e0d69906955d&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.2;text-align: justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;The proposal would increase the dominance of cars on the site and remove elements of green infrastructure that contribute positively to the character of the area. The proposals would be contrary to policies&amp;nbsp; LP1, PP1, LP9, AND LP41&amp;nbsp; of the Hackney Local Plan 2033 Strategic Planning (2020), Policies D4 of the London Plan 2021, Hackney Residential Extensions and Alterations Supplementary Planning Document (2025) and the NPPF.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.2;margin-top:6pt;margin-bottom:6pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;The proposal would result in a degradation of biodiversity on the site through the removal of an existing planter. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;The proposal is therefore contrary to Policies G5 of the London Plan and LP46, LP47, and LP51 of the LP33 and the REA SPD.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;﻿&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;﻿&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;By virtue of providing additional off-street car parking, and removing cycle parking the proposal would be encouraging private car usage.&amp;nbsp; The proposal is not considered to promote car free development, contrary to&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;London Plan Policies T1,T6 and Local Plan Policies P33 Policies LP42, LP45 and the REA SPD.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;"
  ]
}